WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.252
I don't have much of a
script for this video.

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:04.963
A few weeks ago,
I saw a clip of a Japanese inventor

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:09.968
who's been running his own
“Micro Hovercraft Laboratory” for years.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.554
So I asked my local producer in Japan
to get in touch and ask

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.432
while I'm in the country,
can I please meet the inventor?

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:19.519
Can I see the hovercraft
and maybe have a go flying it?

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:23.148
So now we've taken a bullet train to
Tsubame City, two hours north of Tokyo,

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:26.234
and I'm going to meet Hideyasu Ito
at the local sports center.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.778
Now, I do have a little bit of experience
with hovercraft...

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.827
but this is one person's
home-made vehicle, so...

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.871
I'm going to be careful
not to break it.

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:22.290
Hello.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.958
Could you demonstrate?

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.835
Could you show me around? Thank you.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.567
How do you steer?

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:31.943
- This button...

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:35.697
...turn.

00:02:36.948 --> 00:02:38.199
Turn.
- Okay.

00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:40.368
- Both switch...
Straight.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:41.953
Okay?
- Okay.

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:42.996
And this...

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.664
...clockwise, there.

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.835
Up and down.

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:54.883
About 1700.
- One seven zero zero.

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:55.675
Okay.

00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:57.839
Is that okay?

00:04:57.839 --> 00:04:58.923
Hang on...

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.805
That is incredible.

00:05:05.847 --> 00:05:08.766
Thank you so much.
Arigato gozaimasu!

